  PromptDialogue: Oh, come on! If climate change was real, why do we still have record
    snowfalls? If the planet's getting hotter, shouldn't everything be melting?
  correctCardName: IcyIrony
  correctCardSelected: "Alright, I see your point now. Warmer air holds more moisture,
